      "writtenOn": "2020-03-27T05:43:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "CS# is pulled up because the host has received the last byte that is EC_SPI_PAST_END(0xed) from the EC responded data. It means spi parse has been completed and responded data to the host. So, we can clear rx FIFO when the status is IT83XX_SPI_ENDDETECTINT.",
