      "writtenOn": "2020-03-30T14:51:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should at least have your explanation as a comment in this section so we remember that detail when looking back at the code\n\n----\n\nAlthought this does seem racy. If we got both IT83XX_SPI_RXFIFOFULL and IT83XX_SPI_ENDDETECTINT because something got behind, we would clear all data. What is the harm in putting the IT83XX_SPI_RXFIFOFULL section first?",
      "parentUuid": "3b1811ed_16b84ab0",
