        "id": 1273969
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-03-31T06:54:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When we got the IT83XX_SPI_ENDDETECTINT, the status of IT83XX_SPI_RXFIFOFULL would continue to be pulled up because of the sent dummy data. So if IT83XX_SPI_RXFIFOFULL section puts first, we need to use other conditions to block.\n\nIf we got IT83XX_SPI_ENDDETECTINT, it actually represents that the data parse has been completed so AP will pull up CS#(IT83XX_SPI_ENDDETECTINT) and clear all data.",
